		{
			dependencies: ["64AEF0A72A1F29C0"]
			description: [
				"You've finally risen through the ranks and became a lord, as a lord you have access to the hunter employees to help you out."
				""
				"Minions have an inventory that can be used to store items but also to equip the minion with weapons and armor. Furthermore, their appearance can be changed, and you can assign them a new name. Obviously, you can give them commands. Either individually by interacting with the minion and selecting the desired task or by using the minion task menu. The menu can be accessed either by a dedicated keybinding (unbound by default) or by pressing space while your action menu is displayed. You can still access the actions by hitting space in the minion task menu (or by using the action 1/2 keybinding directly)."
				""
				"Minions will stay in the world even when you disconnect from the server or change the dimension. If a minion is hurt severely, it will teleport to safety and recover. Once recovered you can retrieve it using the minion task menu."
				""
				"As a lord you can recruit hunter NPCs by giving them basic hunter minion equipment. However, not all hunters are willing to serve somebody, so you have to look for weaker ones. You can upgrade their equipment and improve their capabilities using hunter minion upgrades."
			]
			id: "1552C693098EB34C"
			rewards: [{
				exclude_from_claim_all: true
				id: "4E621B4DB8EF33F8"
				table_id: 6087682009898504209L
				type: "loot"
			}]
